# Agora Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and configure only the capabilities you use.
#
# The Agora 1.0 Task control plane launches the native Codex, Claude Code, and
# Kiro CLIs through explicit Stage routes. It does not run the retired 0.5
# multi-agent discussion council.

# === Recommended setup ===

# Required to open the authenticated Task Control Plane. Generate a private,
# high-entropy value and enter the same value in the browser connection form.
AGORA_CONTROL_PLANE_TOKEN=

# Optional explicit config file, useful for isolated acceptance or multiple
# local Agora instances. A direct get_config(path) argument still takes
# precedence.
# AGORA_CONFIG_PATH=D:\path\to\isolated-config.yaml

# === Optional ===

# Native CLI authentication is managed by Codex, Claude Code, and Kiro
# themselves. Kiro remains configured even when it is temporarily unavailable.
# Optional embedding-provider credentials may be referenced from an explicit
# `embeddings` block in config.yaml; Agora defines no direct chat-provider
# variables for the retired Council.
